{
  "title": "Ring all-pass coupling",
  "group": "Passive photonics",
  "description": "all-pass microring through critical coupling: κ² = 0.02 / 0.088 / 0.30 vs the 0.4 dB round-trip loss — the notch only bottoms out at κ² = 1-a² = 0.088",
  "schematic": {
    "notes": [
      {
        "x": 40,
        "y": -153,
        "title": "Ring all-pass coupling — what this testbench does",
        "lines": [
          "An all-pass microring: laser LAS feeds coupler CPL,",
          "whose through port is probed (thru at CPL p3). The",
          "ring loop is waveguide WG (~200 um, 20 dB/cm), giving",
          "a round-trip amplitude a. On resonance the thru port",
          "shows a notch.",
          "The sweep steps CPL.coupling k^2 = 0.02 / 0.088 / 0.30.",
          "The notch bottoms out only at critical coupling,",
          "k^2 = 1 - a^2 = 0.088; off critical it stays shallow.",
          "",
          "Set WG.loss_dB_cm = 40 and re-run: critical k^2 shifts."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "instances": {
      "LAS": {
        "type": "cw_laser",
        "x": 40,
        "y": 160,
        "rot": 0,
        "settings": {
          "power": 0.001,
          "wavelength_nm": 1310.0
        }
      },
      "GND": {
        "type": "ground",
        "x": 60,
        "y": 250,
        "rot": 0,
        "settings": {}
      },
      "CPL": {
        "type": "dir_coupler",
        "x": 240,
        "y": 180,
        "rot": 0,
        "settings": {
          "coupling": 0.088
        }
      },
      "WG": {
        "type": "waveguide",
        "x": 240,
        "y": 300,
        "rot": 0,
        "settings": {
          "length_m": 0.000199775,
          "loss_dB_cm": 20.0,
          "neff": 2.4,
          "n_group": 4.0,
          "center_wavelength_nm": 1310.0,
          "wavelength_nm": 1310.0
        }
      },
      "TT": {
        "type": "opt_term",
        "x": 460,
        "y": 168,
        "rot": 0,
        "settings": {}
      }
    },
    "wires": [
      {
        "from": "LAS,p1",
        "to": "CPL,p1"
      },
      {
        "from": "LAS,p2",
        "to": "GND,p1"
      },
      {
        "from": "CPL,p4",
        "to": "WG,p2"
      },
      {
        "from": "WG,p1",
        "to": "CPL,p2"
      },
      {
        "from": "CPL,p3",
        "to": "TT,p1"
      }
    ],
    "probes": [
      {
        "name": "thru",
        "at": "CPL,p3",
        "color": "#6ecbf5"
      }
    ]
  },
  "analysis": {
    "mode": "dcsweep",
    "instance": "*",
    "param": "wavelength_nm",
